/v1/","context":{"app_id":4347560,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4347560-1846018067925430","game_id":"steam-4347560","kind":"announcement","title":"Let there be lights!","summary":"First of all, thanks for playing the demo. This one is a look & feel update.The ride home is at night now. Lamps, wet streets, people walking past. A lot of the street got redone, so the buildings and the people match better:Upgraded lightning at the dinner, and at the booth. Should be more atmospheric now:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T08:55:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925430","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4347560-1845383656387930","game_id":"steam-4347560","kind":"update","title":"2000 Wishlists Milestone Update!","summary":"First of all, thank you, 2000 Wishlists is a clear sign this game is not going anywhere, and that it won't just fade out. Thank you to everyone who made that happen.This update adds more depth to the ending. Last time it left some of you unsure whether the game had crashed, or whether you had clicked the wrong thing.In the ending there's a new page for the chapter. It shows the choices you ended up making, and how other players handled those same choices.Then there is a short epilogue that wraps","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T22:49:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387930","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4347560-1844115010493652","game_id":"steam-4347560","kind":"announcement","title":"Why there's now a Germany-specific build","summary":"A few weeks back we wrote about the review process Checkpoint '38 went through in Germany, where games depicting Nazi symbolism go through a separate review body. Here's where that landed.We built a Germany-specific version, released alongside the global one rather than replacing it. The change is narrow and specific: swastikas and party emblems are swapped for a neutral mark. We want to be precise about what that does and doesn't touch, because it's easy to assume more got changed than actually","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T02:11:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4347560-1843481262698778","game_id":"steam-4347560","kind":"announcement","title":"Why Checkpoint '38 isn't just \"Papers, Please with a different skin\"","summary":"We've seen a version of this comment a lot on comments on our trailer and clips: cool concept, but isn't this just Papers, Please with a different skin? Fair question. Let's answer it properly instead of just nodding along.What you actually doEvery shift, you inspect passports, visas, and permits under Herr Kommissar's growing list of rules, spotting missing stamps and forged papers while the rulebook keeps changing what counts as valid. If you've played Papers, Please, that part will feel famil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T04:11:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698778","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4347560-1842846814444765","game_id":"steam-4347560","kind":"announcement","title":"We're part of Steam Next Fest, October 2026!","summary":"Checkpoint '38 got selected for Steam Next Fest, October 2026. The demo is already live now, and it'll stay up through the event, so you don't have to wait for October to try it.Quick reminder for anyone landing here fresh: Checkpoint '38 is a document checking simulation in the Papers, Please lane. You inspect passports, visas, and permits at the Konstanz–Switzerland border, and the rulebook only gets stricter as you go. What sets it apart is that every traveler is procedurally generated, so th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T22:33:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444765","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4347560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4347560":"2026-10-26T02:11:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4347560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4701480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4347560","app_id":4347560,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"0257bdf8c2a9f5ba347c4fd1e3205841f78dffb358c5a63a1548aee72c979e59","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"You're a German border guard in 1938. Check passports, catch forged papers, and decide who crosses as the rules tighten. Then go home and face your family. Your job is to obey. Your conscience says otherwise. Free demo on Steam during Next Fest.","publishers":[{"name":"Genesis Dawn"}],"developers":[{"name":"Genesis Dawn"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Checkpoint '38 - Updated Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791483535","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4347560/115361304/13edddf74a247ed126bcf0857c54f24dc144539e/1791483097/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4347560/115361304/13edddf74a247ed126bcf0857c54f24dc144539e/1791483097/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4347560/115361304/13edddf74a247ed126bcf0857c54f24dc144539e/1791483097/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4347560/115361304/13edddf74a247ed126bcf0857c54f24dc144539e/1791483097/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4347560/115361304/13edddf74a247ed126bcf0857c54f24dc144539e/1791483097/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257452842/c7e0a72b8f0b3c077cfce46cba9f70d45a949b8b/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257452842/c7e0a72b8f0b3c077cfce46cba9f70d45a949b8b/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1370744,"all_ages":true}]}},"field_present":{"basic_info":true,"release":true,"trailers":true},"field_status":{"basic_info":"ok","release":"ok","trailers":"ok"},"field_errors":{},"developers":["Genesis Dawn"],"publishers":["Genesis Dawn"],"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Checkpoint '38 - Updated Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791483535","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4347560/115361304/13edddf74a247ed126bcf0857c54f24dc144539e/1791483097/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4347560/